$ pda help rms
$ pda rms --help
Delete a store

Usage:
  pda remove-store STORE [flags]

Aliases:
  remove-store, rms

Flags:
  -h, --help          help for remove-store
  -i, --interactive   prompt yes/no for each deletion
  -y, --yes           skip all confirmation prompts
